    and/or "Edge Imp" monsters from your Deck to the GY, equal to the original Level
    of that destroyed monster. When your opponent activates a card or effect that
    targets this card on the field (Quick Effect): You can banish 1 "Frightfur" monster
    from your Extra Deck; negate that effect.'
